title: "attribution-aware-biometric-decisions: code and aggregate results for attribution-aware evaluation of image restoration in biometric access decisions"
abstract: "Detector-level evaluation methods, training configurations and aggregate results, and the analysis code and aggregate results of the credential-level burden (E060) and deployment-policy simulation (E061) analyses, accompanying the manuscript 'Attribution-Aware Evaluation of Image Restoration for Trustworthy Biometric Decisions in Cyber-Physical-Social Systems' (prepared for submission to IEEE Transactions on Computational Social Systems; not yet published)."
